// Template merged on top of apps/cli-installer/wrangler.jsonc by
// bin/deploy.sh. Placeholders use Go-template syntax `{{ .X.Y }}` and are
// substituted by bin/render-wrangler-local.sh from .deploy-state.json +
// .env.deploy.
//
// PR 6 starts on the new Go-template syntax. PR 4 migrates the existing
// services (api, in, out, panel) from the older `${VAR}` shape to match.
//
// Do NOT hand-edit the materialised wrangler.local.jsonc — re-run
// `make configure` instead.
